@startuml

title Process Manager: one component holds the state and decides each next step

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
actor caller
component "process manager\n(ores.workflow)" as pm
database "run state\n(instance, steps, results)" as st
component "definition\n(registered in code)" as def
component "step handler A" as a
component "step handler B" as b

caller --> pm : start (type, request, run id)
pm --> def : build the step list from the request
pm --> st : persist each step before dispatch
pm --> a : command (step id, run id, tenant)
a --> pm : completion event (result or error)
pm --> b : next command, built from earlier results by name
pm --> st : record each outcome
note bottom of pm : handlers never call each other;\nthe manager alone knows the order
@enduml
